  <item>
    <title>ep10.当我们在算命的时候，我们在算什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/684162226dbe9284e7eaf8fd</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">684162226dbe9284e7eaf8fd</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Jun 2025 09:44:01 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是蛮特别的一期，邀请好朋友树林到公园和我一起聊算命~因为环境问题所以会有很多底噪和环境音，提前为不算很好的收音道歉，但剪播客的时候我还蛮喜欢这些环境音的，希望你也能喜欢这期内容，与你握手！</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>• &nbsp;中式算命都是在算什么?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>工具：玄学?八字?紫微斗数?周易?</span></p><span></span><p><span>来算命的都会问些什么?</span></p><span></span><p><span>算命师的日常工作</span></p><span></span><p><span>有趣的故事分享</span></p><span></span><p><span>命真的会越算越薄么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>一命、二运、三风水算命师怎么理解</span></p><span></span><p><span>有什么好玩常用的的口诀</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;• &nbsp;算命是如何进行的?</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>六爻/蓍草/星相学和人怎么关联起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对具体的问题会怎么进行</span></p><span></span><p><span>有什么算命的行业规则（一个问题会不会算两次?/会不会给自己算命?/泄露天机?）</span></p><span></span><p><span>会在什么程度上给予答案</span></p><span></span><p><span>预测准确与否怎么判断</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么改命?</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>&nbsp;• &nbsp;算命与星座，塔罗，心理咨询；</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>算命与上述种种的相似之处</span></p><span></span><p><span>中式玄学和别的玄学有什么不同</span></p><span></span><p><span>怎么看待玄学和心理咨询很相似的作用</span></p><span></span><p><span>算命怎么看待抑郁，双相这些现代心理问题</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;• &nbsp;个人体验</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>怎么样入门算命</span></p><span></span><p><span>在什么程度上有帮助到你</span></p><span></span><p><span>自己对于算命和心理咨询的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为算命师帮助人的感受</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>策划：</span></strong><span>小马</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾：</span></strong><span>树林</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>剪辑后期：</span></strong><span>小马</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>片尾：</span></strong><span>吴卓玲 - We'll follow the wind</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64c7a49f2b235903e600d524/lmsbne08L7xQPd8rCw5_v4RgdR0p.m4a" length="175147665" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>02:00:41</itunes:duration>
