    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今年10月6日， Sufjan Stevens（苏夫扬·史蒂文斯）发布了自己的第十张录音室专辑 《Javelin》，这是一张非常私密的关于个人的专辑，Sufjan Stevens 通过 Instagram 公开这张专辑是献给他已故的搭档、长期的男朋友 Evans Richardson（伊万·理查德森）的专辑，这也是 Sufjan Stevens 首次在公共平台公开自己的性取向。</span></p><p><br></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiXck0c2cwNLhQ9diB-UvgaOEB7P.webp"></figure><p><strong><span>本期主要内容：</span></strong></p><ul><li><p><span>sufjan新专辑歌曲</span></p></li><li><p><span>《请以你的名字呼唤我》</span></p></li><li><p><span>亚历山大和赫费斯提翁</span></p></li><li><p><span>白先勇和王国祥《树犹如此》</span></p></li><li><p><span>《月梦》....</span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span>《javelin》曲目：</span></strong></p><p><span>1. Goodbye Evergreen</span><br><span>2. A Running Start</span><br><span>3. Will Anybody Ever Love Me?</span><br><span>4. Everything That Rises</span><br><span>5. Genuflecting Ghost</span><br><span>6. My Red Little Fox</span><br><span>7. So You Are Tired</span><br><span>8. Javelin (To Have And To Hold)</span><br><span>9. Shit Talk</span><br><span>10. There's A World</span></p><h2><strong><span>策划：</span></strong><span>小马</span></h2><h2><strong><span>录制：</span></strong><span>小马</span></h2><h2><strong><span>剪辑制作：</span></strong><span>小马</span></h2><p><br></p>]]></description>
